# Agnes 2.5 Flash — findings by Qwen 3.8 Flash  ⟦SELF-EXCLUDED ⟦.md.excluded⟧⟧

> **EXCLUSION — no verified public benchmark exists for the exact ID.** `agnes-2.5-flash` (Agnes AI's generally-available flash-tier model) has **no measured capability benchmark** from any reachable source this pass: the official GA API doc publishes **specs only, zero scores**; the only HuggingFace artifact under this name is a **base (pre-trained, non-instruction-tuned) checkpoint with no capability table**; Artificial Analysis returned **404** for the exact ID; and a numbers-focused search surfaced no BenchLM / llm-stats / leaderboard row. With no exact-ID measured row, the five quality dims can't be computed honestly, so this is saved as `<STEM>.md.excluded` (notes only; any numbers inside are ignored) per `RULES.md` § self-exclusion / `tasks/research-assign.md` Step 3.3. **Do not** score it by analogy to Agnes 3.0 Flash or the Agnes 2.5 Pro Alpha (different models).

## What IS verified (spec only — no capability scores)

- **Identity:** `agnes-2.5-flash`, Agnes AI's **generally-available** flash-tier model, "upgraded from the deprecated `agnes-2.0-flash`" (OpenAI-compatible drop-in model-name swap). ⚠️ **`meta.json` conflict:** id `opencode/agnes-2.5-flash` but the short line attributes it to **"Sapiens AI"** — the vendor is **Agnes AI** (apihub.agnes-ai.com); curation should fix the publisher name.
- **Context window:** **512K total / 65.5K max output** (official API doc). (The HF **base** checkpoint extends to 1,048,576 via YaRN, but that is the non-instruct base, not the GA chat API — do not conflate.)
- **Modalities:** text + image-URL in; text out. Tool calling, streaming, adaptive **thinking mode** (`budget_tokens`, ~2048 start for coding). No audio, no non-text output.
- **Pricing:** **$0.05 / $0.15 per 1M in/out**, cached input **$0.005/1M**; "Angel User Trial" $0 across the board.
- **Architecture (from the base repo):** 202B-param sparse MoE, **~16B active/token**, 48 layers, 6-of-160 routed + 1 shared expert, MLA + sparse top-512 indexer, hyper-connections, FP8 checkpoint (~190 GB). Apache 2.0. **This is the base model — the GA instruct API's internals are not separately disclosed.**

