- Official docs `wiki.agnes-ai.com/en/docs/agnes-25-flash` → **no benchmark table** (capability prose only).
- HuggingFace `Agnes-AI/Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base` → **base model, no capability benchmarks** (explicitly "no SFT/RLHF").
- Web search for measured `Agnes 2.5 Flash` GPQA/SWE-bench/MMLU/IFEval numbers → only generic benchmark landing pages, **no exact-ID score**.
- AA article "Agnes AI releases Agnes 2.5 Pro Alpha" is about a **different** model (2.5 **Pro Alpha**, Coding Index 58.8) — not usable for the flash ID.

