Re-research as soon as Artificial Analysis / BenchLM / llm-stats index the exact GA `agnes-2.5-flash` ID with measured rows, or Agnes AI ships an **instruct** HF card with a benchmark table. Then write the scored `Qwen_3.8_Flash.md` and retire this twin (own-twin retirement only).

